'''Lickilicky''' (Japanese: '''ベロベルト''' ''Berobelt'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

